## Task 2: n8n Automation
Created an automated Hacker News digest workflow using n8n.

### Main Workflow
1. Schedule Trigger runs hourly.
2. HTTP Request fetches Hacker News top story IDs.
3. Code node selects the first five stories.
4. HTTP Request fetches story details.
5. Code node filters and sorts stories by score.
6. IF node checks whether the score is greater than 100.
7. Telegram sends alerts for high-scoring stories.

### Error Handling
A separate Error Handler workflow uses Error Trigger and Telegram to send notifications when a workflow fails.

